44px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n           Ragati, Nguguini, Mukangu, Kibingoti, Thunguri, Kianjege, Chewa, Kibirigwi和Kiangai\n          </span>\n<span style='caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);outline: 0px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n           ；合作社总的成员数有近7200户，算是肯尼亚比较大的合作社了\n          </span>\n          。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SnDJzVBSVj90b8rEwIicdTJ4ByFia4sSvUHOPuS0VCBXblBGuNl1Y0XicagPCjf54hmf3VoRlS0vXsQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7S9XRhXhQMII7rELicTM5TUxFuWSmiaygdR4VYH3w08d8xnVk5403A9OXnmWR2eicuOgLLDwiba7AfVRQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;'>\n          Thunguri处理厂\n          <span style=\"caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n           始建于1979年，\n          </span>\n          位于Nyeri，\n          <span style='caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n           紧挨着Kirinyaga，\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n          由近1100名小规模咖啡农共同组成，拥有634.2公顷的咖啡种植土地；种植的咖啡树品种主要为SL28和SL34，占比超过80% 。此外，在肯尼亚研究中心的倡导下，合作社也进行了Ruiru11和Batian品种的实验种植，不过这两个品种的占比较小。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7S9XRhXhQMII7rELicTM5TUxQOlwayPQLDdZpqyxB6adTJFJiaIQTaVu7mtVE5hCpPxlcKLWBN8jeibw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n</span>\n</p>\n<hr style='outline: 0px;lette